      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "During the Civil War, the area was known as Fort Buffalo, a fortification built in October 1862 by the 21st New York Infantry to guard the Leesburg Pike.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28,
        29,
        30
